      "type": "text",
      "text": "Moderate to severe extraglandular manifestations need systemic tx: GCs, antimalarials (eg, HCQ), steroid-sparing immunosuppressants (MTX, azathioprine, mycophenolate mofetil, leflunomide); rituximab or cyclophosphamide occasionally."
